From: mscharged-port contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Share original resident cue event lifecycle
Upstream-base: bab83befb5d6a2fdff0b30d2ec4b59f7251a108d

Share original event/sequence/cue state and source-completion rules, instance
clock/state aggregation and active-count lifetime. Console methods delegate to
the same helpers. Native retained owners qualify static resident one-shot
profiles without selecting streams, RPC or whole AudioBackend initialization.

